: 0.04114490085177952, "h": 0.007587208988864585, "text": "Jess:", "x": 0.13059034095753297}, {"x": 0.17531306190268278, "w": 0.096601070827908, "text": "Never. He c", "h": 0.01021214643110008, "y": 0.33763081403600886}, {"x": 0.3470483019013115, "text": "_ (buy) me anything!", "y": 0.3376308143158687, "w": 0.13953487820095484, "h": 0.012645348314774147}, {"y": 0.35530234675258127, "w": 0.10017889234754775, "h": 0.009029783393501837, "x": 0.10912343522157493, "text": "4 Oliver: a"}, {"h": 0.011440160007683312, "x": 0.22898031828567678, "y": 0.35406976774018295, "text": "the teachers at your school b", "w": 0.20214669121636286}, {"y": 0.3692441862109228, "x": 0.186046513239485, "w": 0.07692307366265194, "h": 0.008851743820341854, "text": "(wear) ties?"}, {"x": 0.13059033980219614, "h": 0.008851743820341854, "text": "Jean:", "y": 0.3831540698396474, "w": 0.04114490085177952}, {"x": 0.18781151676775418, "w": 0.06802633921305337, "h": 0.010277853089549425, "text": "No, they", "y": 0.38307328279835484}, {"w": 0.17352415296766494, "x": 0.2951699471521245, "text": "but they look quite smart.", "y": 0.383154069986731, "h": 0.011408204330864402}, {"y": 0.4210901164509389, "x": 0.08586762067645042, "w": 0.3989266628689236, "h": 0.011554287852793362, "text": "2 * Look at the information and complete the dialogue"}, {"h": 0.011385379061371907, "y": 0.43499999984487725, "w": 0.3881931898328993, "text": "with the correct negative form of the verbs in brackets.", "x": 0.10733453694848764}, {"h": 0.01138081348329678, "text": "Alex,", "y": 0.4666133723439257, "w": 0.030411449008517777, "x": 0.14490161040182342}, {"x": 0.14311271072580944, "text": "I'm at work. Here are the things for you to do:", "h": 0.015311371841155259, "w": 0.26654739379882814, "y": 0.4868231048388881}, {"text": "do the shopping, finish your homework,", "y": 0.5095938624469643, "h": 0.01265904430017569, "x": 0.1431127012193687, "w": 0.23434704250759547}, {"x": 0.14311270032617598, "y": 0.524781976830987, "w": 0.20393559773763023, "h": 0.013909883895075253, "text": "tidy your room, learn some French,"}, {"text": "read your English book, write to Aunt Louisa", "x": 0.14311269974846677, "h": 0.014133574007220128, "y": 0.5398240071155125, "w": 0.2558139546712239}, {"x": 0.1449016154078017, "text": "to thank her for your present.", "w": 0.16994632297092013, "y": 0.5551308144254617, "h": 0.012645348314774147}, {"h": 0.013928144709728278, "x": 0.1431127008288989, "text": "See you at seven o'clock.", "y": 0.5753633718320772, "w": 0.14669052124023438}, {"x": 0.37924865810743363, "w": 0.033989266289605025, "text": "Mum", "y": 0.5829505816296137, "h": 0.010116278651819317}, {"x": 0.10733452733642246, "h": 0.011481246091828929, "y": 0.6195216607025085, "w": 0.3309481133355035, "text": "Mum: Hi, Alex, I'm home. Did you see my note?"}, {"y": 0.6335319768891022, "x": 0.10733452754805216, "h": 0.008851743820341951, "w": 0.03577817281087238, "text": "Alex:"}, {"x": 0.16229513511335844, "y": 0.6346317427862052, "text": "Er ..., yes.", "w": 0.06509105258517794, "h": 0.009841525503013909}, {"y": 0.6473962094334789, "x": 0.105545620009889, "h": 0.011426464771105508, "w": 0.21288013034396702, "text": "Mum: Did you do everything?"}, {"text": "Alex:", "w": 0.03577817281087238, "x": 0.10733452754805216, "y": 0.6613517443309629, "h": 0.008851743820341854}, {"text": "Er ... not quite.", "x": 0.16100178868838164, "h": 0.010116278651819317, "y": 0.6613517444371717, "w": 0.10375670539008244}, {"y": 0.6750506946199342, "x": 0.1054603912633534, "text": "Mum:", "h": 0.00927361087248214, "w": 0.043104260762532556}, {"y": 0.6752616281159508, "w": 0.15026833428276906, "text": "So, what did you do?", "x": 0.15384615235772112, "h": 0.010216711260351466}, {"text": "Alex:", "y": 0.6891715118739861, "w": 0.03756708357069227, "h": 0.008851743820341951, "x": 0.10554561680141597}, {"y": 0.6878339347222754, "h": 0.014133574007220224, "text": "Well, I didn't do the shopping. I'", "w": 0.22719139946831596, "x": 0.15921288964419616}, {"text": "(know) what to buy. And | 2", "x": 0.15921288027088992, "y": 0.7018168607634389, "h": 0.011536027412552254, "w": 0.18067977905273436}, {"y": 0.7008924420875082, "text": "(do) my", "h": 0.01554941840120173, "w": 0.057555105421278174, "x": 0.43187879244795746}, {"text": "homework but there isn't much to do.", "x": 0.16100179869436437, "w": 0.25223612467447915, "y": 0.7168862816351508, "h": 0.010221276464014675}, {"x": 0.10554561921150875, "y": 0.7309011629261298, "w": 0.042933807373046876, "h": 0.008851743820341951, "text": "Mum:"}, {"w": 0.03756708357069226, "text": "Alex:", "x": 0.10554561805365205, "y": 0.7448110466734046, "h": 0.008851743820341951}, {"h": 0.012955776173285286, "w": 0.16994632297092016, "x": 0.1538461558967702, "y": 0.7294494581877079, "text": "Did you tidy your room?"}, {"y": 0.7435465117207426, "h": 0.011421899941854122, "x": 0.1610017924214572, "w": 0.07871198018391926, "text": "Well, no. 13"}, {"text": "(tidy) my room and", "w": 0.12880143059624566, "x": 0.3309481209911693, "h": 0.011431029974768813, "y": 0.7447608303184785}, {"h": 0.010116278651819317, "y": 0.7574563956842648, "text": "14", "x": 0.1574239720030064, "w": 0.01788908640543621}, {"y": 0.7573240071089017, "x": 0.2683363187771412, "w": 0.1252236090766059, "h": 0.01151320176864784, "text": "(learn) any French."}, {"w": 0.042933807373046876, "y": 0.772630814073114, "text": "Mum:", "x": 0.1055456193903996, "h": 0.008851743820341951}, {"y": 0.7726308142096598, "x": 0.1502683350436184, "w": 0.2200357733832465, "text": "What about your English book?", "h": 0.011389943890623196}, {"w": 0.03935599009195964, "x": 0.10375671027602373, "text": "Alex:", "y": 0.7865406978517793, "h": 0.010116278651819317}, {"w": 0.18604649861653644, "h": 0.012722955653813801, "x": 0.161001798515226, "text": "Oh yes. I read some of that.", "y": 0.785198555755027}, {"text": "Mum:", "x": 0.10549701378868166, "y": 0.8003314466562468, "h": 0.009090013529849809, "w": 0.04303101857503254}, {"text": "How much?", "y": 0.8004505816414278, "w": 0.08944543626573351, "h": 0.008851743820341951, "x": 0.15026833583254776}, {"w": 0.037567083570692286, "y": 0.8143604652999624, "h": 0.010116278651819414, "text": "Alex:", "x": 0.1037567090375519}, {"w": 0.055456169976128455, "h": 0.01266817395867856, "text": "Well, 15", "y": 0.8130731046918045, "x": 0.15742397272660483}, {"x": 0.30590339837763675, "w": 0.16100179036458329, "text": "(read) much. About half", "y": 0.813073104639018, "h": 0.011403639501612918}, {"h": 0.011499506532069942, "text": "a page. It was really boring and I wanted to write", "x": 0.15921288418749455, "y": 0.8282703489837877, "w": 0.32558139377170137}, {"h": 0.010207581227436775, "x": 0.15921288180441173, "text": "to Aunt Louisa.", "w": 0.10196779886881507, "y": 0.8421254514463902}, {"y": 0.8546886283312082, "w": 0.3649373711480035, "x": 0.10375672056791826, "h": 0.012955776173285189, "text": "Mum: That's good. I've got a stamp here. You can go"}, {"h": 0.010116278651819317, "y": 0.05437500026316845, "x": 0.5259391773508515, "text": "3", "w": 0.008944543202718092}, {"y": 0.31486918634001076, "h": 0.008851743820341854, "x": 0.5223613600354353, "text": "4", "w": 0.010733451843261688}, {"y": 0.0543750001560624, "h": 0.01138081348329678, "x": 0.5491949940528876, "w": 0.37567084418402774, "text": "** Complete the questions and negatives with the"}, {"text": "correct forms of the verbs in brackets.", "x": 0.5474060846709387, "w": 0.2754919433593751, "h": 0.011499506532070037, "y": 0.06702034888262488}, {"text": "Jo: So, how was the match? (you/win) Did you win?", "x": 0.5456171757061105, "w": 0.35957065158420143, "h": 0.014133574007220224, "y": 0.08715704005975292}, {"w": 0.09491215176052525, "h": 0.013025001928694355, "x": 0.5473560891448739, "y": 0.1009729643644761, "text": "Al: No, we 1"}, {"h": 0.010248666937170475, "x": 0.7352415041559033, "y": 0.10242732585359615, "text": "(not/win) but we", "w": 0.11270124647352431}, {"text": "_(not/lose). It was 2-2.", "y": 0.11503158851686601, "h": 0.011421899567442204, "w": 0.159212883843316, "x": 0.6726296953621823}, {"y": 0.13024709333339263, "x": 0.5456171743732534, "text": "Jo", "w": 0.01967799504597978, "h": 0.010116278651819317}, {"h": 0.012745781297718214, "w": 0.22361358642578122, "text": "(Aggie/come) and see you play?", "x": 0.6815742421180575, "y": 0.12898255842604314}, {"h": 0.010116278651819317, "text": "Al:", "x": 0.5456171735907247, "y": 0.14415697687728804, "w": 0.025044723086886878}, {"text": "Yes, but she*", "y": 0.1415616738264013, "h": 0.012777814477789787, "x": 0.5706460745988465, "w": 0.10557725694444442}, {"w": 0.16815741644965276, "h": 0.011399074297949709, "x": 0.7584973224996816, "text": "_(not/stay) until the end.", "y": 0.14289244201652748}, {"x": 0.5794765158086032, "y": 0.15545784121499207, "text": "I scored a goal but she 5", "w": 0.1685209147135417, "h": 0.01362703671093878}, {"text": "(not/see) it.", "w": 0.07871198018391923, "x": 0.8372093040940869, "y": 0.15664711188241218, "h": 0.009029783393501837}, {"y": 0.16944767450112524, "h": 0.010116278651819317, "w": 0.041144900851779576, "text": "Jo: 6", "x": 0.5474060830043427}, {"h": 0.013909883895075253, "y": 0.16944767415765863, "x": 0.6833631566218548, "w": 0.19856886121961803, "text": "(you/phone) her and tell her?"}, {"y": 0.18334386298547758, "h": 0.010207581227436775, "text": "Al: Of course!", "x": 0.5474060816256399, "w": 0.10733452690972223}, {"x": 0.547406082753219, "text": "Jo: What 7", "h": 0.01029888305423059, "y": 0.19708483754057438, "w": 0.08050089518229164}, {"y": 0.1968958801455523, "x": 0.7208023119808591, "w": 0.07181219312879783, "h": 0.01338847196489468, "text": "(she/say)?"}, {"text": "Al: Not much. She", "h": 0.012690999602582876, "x": 0.5456171746881221, "w": 0.1484794277615018, "y": 0.20991279083243844}, {"w": 0.11270124647352431, "y": 0.2111773257161595, "x": 0.7906976774966903, "h": 0.012645348314774147, "text": "(not/sound) very"}, {"y": 0.22587994511531603, "tex